## Deployment Notes

### How to Deploy
1. Push to `main` branch - auto-deploys both services
2. Manual deploy via Render dashboard
3. Use `npm run publish` script (if configured)

### Important Considerations
- Backend must be deployed and running before frontend can connect
- WebSocket URL uses `wss://` (secure) in production
- Environment variables with `VITE_` prefix are embedded at build time
- Free tier services spin down after 15 minutes of inactivity

### Troubleshooting
- Check Render logs in dashboard if deployment fails
- Verify environment variables are set correctly
- Ensure CORS is configured for the frontend URL
- WebSocket connections require the backend to be awake

